								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Tavernia is a multiplayer party game of trivia, duels and conquest for 2 to 8 players.</strong> Pull up a chair, claim tiles on a hand-painted map, and defend your kingdom by beating your friends at whatever the cards throw at you: trivia, word races, drawing, rhythm, reflexes and more. The last castle standing, or the richest ruler when the rounds run out, wins the tavern.</p><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294030/extras/004ff595d967d7d3788bead7c6f51860.avif?t=1792835480" width=1232 height=200 /></span><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >On your turn, pick a tile on the board. Free land is won with a trivia question; land that belongs to a rival means a duel. Every tile you hold earns points, borders matter, and losing your castle knocks you out of the game.</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Thousands of questions across dozens of topics, in English, Czech and German<br></li><li>Pick your topic from a hand of offers, or re-roll for a better one<br></li><li>Stuck on a hard one? Use 50/50 or Ask the Tavern</li></ul><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294030/extras/3080335b61e6df8906661d3d917658c9.avif?t=1792835480" width=1232 height=200 /></span><br><p class="bb_paragraph" >Attacking a rival plays a minigame card from your hand. Build a deck of your five favourites, ban the one you hate, and drag your opponent onto your home turf.</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><strong>Wordlock</strong>: crack the hidden word before your rival<br></li><li><strong>Typewriter</strong>: out-type your opponent, word by word<br></li><li><strong>Tavern Drums</strong>: keep the beat with a tavern band<br></li><li><strong>Perfect Circle</strong>: draw a rounder circle by hand, no guides<br></li><li><strong>Cartographer</strong>: pin cities on a world map<br></li><li><strong>Catacombs</strong>: find your way out of the maze first<br></li><li><strong>Lockpick</strong>, <strong>Numeris</strong>, <strong>Masterwork</strong>, <strong>Mirrorbound</strong>, <strong>Detective</strong>, <strong>Word Chain</strong>, <strong>Letter Soup</strong>, <strong>Arcane Reveal</strong>, <strong>Phantom Phrases</strong>, <strong>Hands of Fate</strong>, <strong>Flashpoint</strong>, <strong>Wisdom's Path</strong> and more</li></ul><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294030/extras/5d987866d830374cf3f9dc1ace2a7bf8.avif?t=1792835480" width=1232 height=200 /></span><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Up to 8 players per room; invite Steam friends straight from the lobby<br></li><li>Public rooms, private rooms and Quick Match<br></li><li>Spectate any game and watch every keystroke, pencil stroke and drumbeat live<br></li><li><strong>Streamers</strong>: connect Twitch or Kick and your chat joins in, bets on duels and earns beers (XP) for their own accounts</li></ul><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294030/extras/e9af2faab3fa88b1f42598b217a04d1e.avif?t=1792835480" width=1232 height=200 /></span><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Level up, unlock achievements and climb the leaderboards<br></li><li>Upgrade your cards from common to legendary by winning duels with them<br></li><li>Earn profile frames and dress your hand in new skins<br></li><li>Join a guild with your friends or community</li></ul><br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><img class="bb_img" src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4294030/extras/10fce00bfed92e2be6df7a940949c468.avif?t=1792835480" width=1232 height=200 /></span><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>2–8 player online multiplayer<br></li><li>18 duel minigames plus solo trivia and a shared round challenge every round<br></li><li>English, Czech and German, with questions written for each language<br></li><li>Spectator mode and Twitch/Kick chat integration<br></li><li>Cross-play with players on the web version<br></li><li>Original medieval tavern soundtrack</li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Some assets were created with the assistance of generative AI.				</i>
			</p>
